{title: All Hail King Jesus}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse}
[D]All hail King Jes[A]us,
All hail [G]Emmanu[D]el!
[Gb]King of Kings,
[Bm]Lord of Lords,
[E7]Bright Morning [Em/G]Star![A]
[A7]And for [D]all eterni[D7]ty,
I'll sing y[G]our prai[Em]ses;
And I'll [D/A]reign with Y[Bm7]ou
[G]Through out [A7]eternit[D]y
